IT'S OPENING NIGHT! 

Your Spartan Men's Basketball Team is at home tonight for the first time in 2025-26 as they battle Bethesda. Game time is set for 7:00 PM in the Provident Credit Union Event Center and admission is FREE for all SJSU students with a Tower ID.

PLUS, students can score a FREE men's basketball poster while supplies last! Be sure to stick around after the game for an autograph session with the team! 



